  "description": "Hi-end sealed bearing rear hub for a smoother ride and less maintenance.\n\nAftermarket Eastern Atom Cranks made from heat treated tubular chromoly for optimal lightweight strength.\n\nThe retro styled Commando 24\" Big BMX Cruiser Bike LTD edition comes with 3 pc cranks, plus chromo frame and fork. The Commando old school cruiser bike is super durable with a modern geometry making it easier and more fun to ride than its predecessors. The Commando is a throwback with cool retro details like a layback seatpost, big front-end gussets and retro fork dropouts. We have updated this classic style with features like Eastern’s laser cut head tube logo, Eastern logo tires to smooth out the streets and trails, alloy sprocket and flangeless Eastern Riblet grips. The Commando will turn heads everywhere it goes.",
